{"task_id": "Mbpp/12", "solution": "def sort_matrix(matrix: List[List[Number]]) -> List[List[Number]]:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a matrix in ascending order based on the sum of its rows.\"\"\"\n    \n    rows_with_sums = []\n    for row in matrix:\n        rows_with_sums.append((sum(row), row))\n\n    rows_with_sums.sort()\n\n    return [row for _, row in rows_with_sums]"}
