{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "def even_Power_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Validate n and return sum_{k=1..n} (2*k)**5 as int.\n    Raises TypeError if n is not int, ValueError if n < 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    _validate_n(n)\n    return _compute_sum(n)\n\ndef _validate_n(n) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Raise TypeError if not int; raise ValueError if n < 0.\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input n must be an integer.\")\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input n must be a non-negative integer.\")\n\ndef _compute_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return sum_{k=1..n} (2*k)**5. Return 0 when n == 0.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(1, n + 1):\n        total_sum += (2 * k) ** 5\n    return total_sum"}
