{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "def validate_comparability(seq, value):\n    \"\"\"Ensures elements in seq are comparable to value, raising TypeError on failure.\"\"\"\n    if not seq:\n        return\n    for element in seq:\n        try:\n            _ = element <= value\n        except TypeError:\n            raise TypeError(\"Elements in the sequence are not comparable to the specified value.\")\n\ndef binary_search_right(seq, value):\n    \"\"\"Performs a binary search to find the rightmost insertion index.\"\"\"\n    lo = 0\n    hi = len(seq)\n    while lo < hi:\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n        if seq[mid] <= value:\n            lo = mid + 1\n        else:\n            hi = mid\n    return lo\n\ndef right_insertion(seq, value):\n    \"\"\"Locates the right insertion point for a value in a sorted sequence.\"\"\"\n    if not seq:\n        return 0\n    validate_comparability(seq, value)\n    idx = binary_search_right(seq, value)\n    return idx"}
